{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 15733396627979288361,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "GitHub Releases",
      "source_hash": 1510080491914916904,
      "context_hash": 4586590300843633035,
      "translation": "GitHub 릴리스",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:34.551334Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Triagebot can be used to automatically create releases on GitHub when a tag is pushed, using the relevant section of the changelog as the release body.",
      "source_hash": 17591055128299771479,
      "context_hash": 17836576128492534099,
      "translation": "Triagebot은 태그가 푸시될 때 changelog의 관련 절을 릴리스 본문으로 사용하여 GitHub에 릴리스를 자동으로 생성하는 데 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:38.862876Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "No artifacts are uploaded when doing this.",
      "source_hash": 11014850497980472298,
      "context_hash": 10669120551767755936,
      "translation": "이 작업을 수행할 때 아티팩트는 업로드되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:34.551335Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Usage",
      "source_hash": 8769925957682373409,
      "context_hash": 8199884780073496687,
      "translation": "사용법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:34.551335Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Any time you push a git tag, or update the contents of the changelog, triagebot will synchronize *all* tags with the releases.",
      "source_hash": 17909434686208467901,
      "context_hash": 4702795811407828071,
      "translation": "git 태그를 푸시하거나 changelog의 내용을 갱신할 때마다, triagebot은 *모든* 태그를 릴리스와 동기화합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:38.862876Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "That is, any tag that doesn't have a release will create a new release.",
      "source_hash": 15338215014025609081,
      "context_hash": 16109095415509207185,
      "translation": "즉, 릴리스가 없는 태그는 새 릴리스를 생성합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:34.551335Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Additionally, the text of all the releases will be synchronized with the text in the changelog.",
      "source_hash": 4169738592101183522,
      "context_hash": 4486598678284465718,
      "translation": "또한 모든 릴리스의 텍스트는 변경 이력의 텍스트와 동기화됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:34.551335Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Tags that don't have entries in the changelog will not create a release.",
      "source_hash": 4632947614489599878,
      "context_hash": 14651993370667857153,
      "translation": "변경 이력에 항목이 없는 태그는 릴리스를 생성하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:34.551335Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Configuration",
      "source_hash": 4935613502183038470,
      "context_hash": 6257410452338282950,
      "translation": "설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:34.551335Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "To enable automatically creating GitHub Releases, add this to the `triagebot.toml` at the root of your repository:",
      "source_hash": 15878270982478103064,
      "context_hash": 9497756057131389451,
      "translation": "GitHub 릴리스 자동 생성을 활성화하려면, 저장소 루트의 `triagebot.toml`에 다음을 추가하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:34.551336Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The `format` defines which format the changelog file adheres to, and it's used to properly extract the relevant section from it.",
      "source_hash": 6942081223241753781,
      "context_hash": 3904875000027645244,
      "translation": "`format`은 변경 이력 파일이 따르는 형식을 정의하며, 이는 관련 섹션을 올바르게 추출하는 데 사용됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:34.551336Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "You can add another format by changing triagebot's [`src/changelogs/`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/tree/master/src/changelogs).",
      "source_hash": 14062932428352794098,
      "context_hash": 13344907310378095028,
      "translation": "triagebot의 [`src/changelogs/`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/tree/master/src/changelogs)를 변경하여 다른 형식을 추가할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:38.862877Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "The currently supported formats are:",
      "source_hash": 8547561786432114796,
      "context_hash": 7764626265037276965,
      "translation": "현재 지원되는 형식은 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:34.551336Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "`rustc`: follows the custom style of rustc's [RELEASES.md](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/RELEASES.md).",
      "source_hash": 2080974849872474188,
      "context_hash": 1618251345914917162,
      "translation": "`rustc`: rustc의 [RELEASES.md](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/RELEASES.md)의 사용자 정의 스타일을 따릅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "rustc": "rustc"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:38.862877Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "The `project-name` defines what the title of the release should be.",
      "source_hash": 13842206195949902560,
      "context_hash": 11606805106216426433,
      "translation": "`project-name`은 릴리스의 제목이 무엇이 되어야 하는지를 정의합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:34.551336Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "The final title will be `{project-name} {tag}`.",
      "source_hash": 3709656826313338819,
      "context_hash": 14098776234425764591,
      "translation": "최종 제목은 `{project-name} {tag}`가 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:34.551336Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "The `changelog-path` and `changelog-branch` keys define where triagebot should look at when searching for the changelog.",
      "source_hash": 17552248119038562726,
      "context_hash": 6928999733643520679,
      "translation": "`changelog-path`와 `changelog-branch` 키는 triagebot이 changelog를 찾을 때 살펴볼 위치를 정의합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:38.862877Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14188291987651099077,
      "context_hash": 1623049324567206538,
      "translation": "구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:34.551336Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "See [`src/handlers/github_releases.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/github_releases.rs) and [`src/changelogs/`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/tree/HEAD/src/changelogs).",
      "source_hash": 10129042986884050314,
      "context_hash": 5801226501789644448,
      "translation": "[`src/handlers/github_releases.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/github_releases.rs)와 [`src/changelogs/`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/tree/HEAD/src/changelogs)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:34.551336Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}